    {
      "id": "BattleHallScene_Text_BattleHallMatron",
      "en_US": "Will you battle against the Hall Matron?",
      "fr_FR": "Voulez-vous affronter la Lady Scène?"
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleHallScene_Text_HallMatronApproaching",
      "en_US": [
        "Excuse me!\n",
        "Please hold on a moment.\r",
        "In recognition of your remarkable\n",
        "winning streak, our Frontier Brain is\f",
        "demanding a match with you.\r",
        "Actually, you have no choice.\n",
        "You must battle our Hall Matron!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Excusez-moi! Puis-je avoir votre\n",
        "attention un moment?\r",
        "Vous avez impressionné notre Meneur\n",
        "de Zone, qui a décidé de vous affronter\f",
        "en personne.\r",
        "Alors préparez-vous, vous allez\n",
        "affronter la Lady Scène!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleHallScene_Text_ArgentaIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Argenta: My Battle Hall allows Trainers\n",
        "to mount challenges with their one\f",
        "favorite Pokémon.\r",
        "I imagine there were tense moments\n",
        "getting here with your chosen one.\r",
        "But understand that one shines the\n",
        "brightest when a challenge is overcome.\r",
        "I am Argenta, and I am your final and\n",
        "most daunting challenge.\r",
        "I dare you to overcome my challenge.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Célosia: Sur ma Scène de Combat, les\n",
        "Dresseurs affrontent toutes les\f",
        "épreuves avec leur Pokémon favori.\r",
        "Un Dresseur, un Pokémon. J’imagine que\n",
        "ça n’a pas été facile d’arriver à ce\f",
        "niveau.\r",
        "Mais sache que c’est à travers de\n",
        "telles épreuves que l’on grandit.\r",
        "Je m’appelle Célosia, et je suis\n",
        "ton ultime adversaire. Prépare-toi!\r",
        "J’espère que tu seras à la hauteur.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleHallScene_Text_ArgentaIntroGold",
      "en_US": [
        "Argenta: Well!\n",
        "My goodness, your Pokémon...\f",
        "It’s got star power beyond belief.\r",
        "Even from inside its Poké Ball, I can\n",
        "feel its charismatic brilliance.\r",
        "But I’m the Hall Matron.\n",
        "I’ll be the judge of that.\r",
        "I must battle it for myself and see if\n",
        "that brilliance is genuine.\r",
        "That is why we must battle now.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Célosia: Bien!\n",
        "Waouh... Ton Pokémon!\f",
        "Son charisme rayonne intensément.\r",
        "De l’intérieur même de sa Poké Ball, il\n",
        "parvient à faire sentir sa présence.\r",
        "En tant que Meneur de Zone, je me dois\n",
        "de déterminer sa valeur au combat.\r",
        "Ton Pokémon et toi devrez me vaincre\n",
        "pour prouver que vous êtes réellement\f",
        "dignes de la Scène de Combat.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleHallScene_Text_BeatArgenta",
      "en_US": [
        "Argenta: A good Trainer doesn’t force\n",
        "their favorite on anyone.\r",
        "A good one keeps with their favorite\n",
        "without drama or fanfare.\r",
        "That is how I see it, at least.\r",
        "And, by the way I see it, you’re an\n",
        "excellent Trainer!\r",
        "Be sure to visit the Battle Hall again\n",
        "with a favorite Pokémon.\r",
        "Until then, bye-bye!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Célosia: Un bon Dresseur n’exhibe pas\n",
        "son Pokémon favori comme un trophée.\r",
        "Au contraire, un bon Dresseur doit\n",
        "savoir faire preuve d’humilité.\r",
        "Et d’après ce que je vois, tu es\n",
        "toi-même un excellent Dresseur!\r",
        "Reviens à la Scène de Combat avec\n",
        "un de tes Pokémon favoris.\r",
        "Je suis certaine que nous nous\n",
        "reverrons.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleHallScene_Text_BeatArgentaGold",
      "en_US": [
        "Argenta: You must never forget there\n",
        "is a place where everyone can shine.\r",
        "That goes for any and every kind of\n",
        "Pokémon, too.\r",
        "Spread that message in your own words.\n",
        "It’s one everyone should hear.\r",
        "And now, having lost, this lady has\n",
        "nothing left to say at all, but...\r",
        "Bye-bye!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Célosia: N’oublie jamais que tout le\n",
        "monde a une place dans ce monde.\r",
        "Non seulement tous les humains, mais\n",
        "aussi tous les Pokémon.\r",
        "C’est un message que tu peux\n",
        "transmettre à tout le monde.\r",
        "Médite sur ces mots. Quant à moi,\n",
        "il ne me reste qu’une chose à dire:\f",
        "au revoir!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
